[22.323826, "o", "\u001b[1mWhy this score\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.323826, "o", "  • [ssh:22] (medium) SSH OpenSSH banner advertises password-only auth — OpenSSH banner offers only \r\npassword auth (password)\r\n"]
[25.323872, "o", "  • [ssh:22] (medium) SSH arbitrary credential acceptance — random user_a60:**** accepted; 2nd login\r\nuser_a25:**** also accepted\r\n"]
[25.323935, "o", "  • [ssh:22] (high) SSH sftp subsystem missing after login (shell-only lure) — sftp subsystem \r\nfailed: Channel closed.\r\n"]
[25.323984, "o", "  • [ssh:22] (medium) SSH uname/cpuinfo / Cowrie identity — canned internal-error stub\r\n"]
[25.324046, "o", "  • [ssh:22] (medium) SSH filesystem does not persist across sessions — wrote /tmp/hpaudit_d0ddaa57 \r\nthen new login could not read it\r\n"]
[25.324293, "o", "  • [telnet:23] (medium) Telnet IAC AYT is unanswered — IAC AYT unanswered\r\n  • [mysql:3306] (medium) MySQL returns an emulator seq FSM on wrong auth packet sequence — emulator\r\nseq FSM on wrong auth sequence (1835: Expected seq(1) got seq(0))\r\n  • [postgres:5433] (medium) Postgres offers only cleartext password after SSL reject — SSLRequest →\r\nN then AuthenticationCleartextPassword only\r\n  • [multi] (medium) Multiple protocol tells corroborate the same host — +15% for 4 protocol lures \r\n(>1 at 5% each): mysql, postgres, ssh, telnet\r\n"]
[25.324347, "o", "  • [multi] (high) High-signal decoy fingerprint — +15% for high-fidelity tell(s): \r\nssh.sftp_subsystem\r\n"]
[25.32452, "o", "\u001b[2;33mpreset\u001b[0m\u001b[2m=\u001b[0m\u001b[2;35mboth\u001b[0m\u001b[2m \u001b[0m\u001b[2;33mtimeout\u001b[0m\u001b[2m=\u001b[0m\u001b[1;2;36m3\u001b[0m\u001b[1;2;36m.\u001b[0m\u001b[2m0s \u001b[0m\u001b[2;33mdeep\u001b[0m\u001b[2m=\u001b[0m\u001b[2;3;91mFalse\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.324606, "o", "\u001b[2mClosed ports are skipped and do not raise the score.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.324727, "o", "\u001b[2m-p/--port selects only the listed ports \u001b[0m\u001b[1;2m(\u001b[0m\u001b[2mpreset not applied\u001b[0m\u001b[1;2m)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
