[42.418293, "o", "\r\n  Verdict    : Confirmed Honeypot\r\n  Score      : 100%\r\n  Confidence : high\r\n  Tactical   : SKIP_TARGET\r\n  Triggers   : 16\r\n    • ssh.password_only — OpenSSH banner offers only password auth (password)\r\n    • ssh.arbitrary_auth — random user_a82:**** accepted; 2nd login user_a15:**** also acce\r\n    • ssh.sftp_subsystem — sftp subsystem failed: Channel closed.\r\n    • ssh.uname — canned internal-error stub\r\n    • ssh.session_persist — wrote /tmp/hpaudit_68acab9b then new login could not read it\r\n    • telnet.ayt_stub — IAC AYT unanswered\r\n    • mysql.seq_order — emulator seq FSM on wrong auth sequence (1835: Expected seq(1) g\r\n"]
[45.418293, "o", "    • postgres.cleartext — SSLRequest → N then AuthenticationCleartextPassword only\r\n    • deep.shell_semantics — arith: expected '2993', got 'Internal error. Please try again la\r\n    … +7 more\r\n\r\n"]
